    "name": "L_LG",
    "definition": "Leak-aware training objective under matched MAX_EPOCHS: L_LG = w_iso(g) * L_task(x, g), with optional late stage-band dropout on the mini-batch support. L_task is the stem's usual OrdProg loss (CE3 + progress + CORAL/CE5).",
    "iso_weight": "For each train stage g, d(g)=min_{g'\u2260g}|g-g'| over the train pool; normalize d to [0,1] \u2192 \u00f1(g); then w_iso(g)=1 + \u03b1\u00b7\u00f1(g) with \u03b1=1.0. Isolated stages (large min gap) are upweighted; neighbours are not deleted.",
